https://genomebiology.biomedcentral.com/articles/10.1186/s13059-018-1568-0
(Genome Biology, 2018)Learning Objective 1=E2=80=A2 Learning the basics for
metagenomics, what it is, how it works and what process steps a metagenomic
analysis consists ofLearning Objective 2=E2=80=A2 Understanding the potenti=
al of
metagenomics for pathogen detection and in particular for diagnostics
